      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have done the following steps and have been able to solve the problem in my environment.\n\n1. Revert SteamVR to the released version.\n\n2. Shut down Steam.\n\n3. Run Pimax's Restart Service.\n\n4. Start Steam.\n\n5. Launch SteamVR.\n\nThis issue affects many VR games, not just VRChat.\n\nI think it is more likely that this is not an issue caused by the VRChat update, but between the SteamVR Beta update and Pimax, which may have been delivered at a close time.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
