      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{640eecb8b27a3b4538b1d29c|full_name} The current workaround is to disable skeleton tracking data from the skeleton button in steamvr bindings, this won't fix finger tracking but it will fix the broken fingers and hand offsets, it won't however fix the rotated hands.\n\nThe issue seems to be with the way Pimax headsets interface with index controllers, in Pimax's launcher the controllers show up as vive controllers but this was not an issue until the most recent vrc update.\n\nYou can select the previous release of steamvr from the betas tab but I have not tested this since i literally just got out of VR.",
